</div></div><div class="py-3 border-bottom"><div class="d-flex flex-column flex-md-row flex-wrap justify-content-between align-items-start align-items-md-center">
                  <div class="d-flex flex-column flex-wrap"><div class="d-flex flex-column flex-wrap"><p class="language-meta mb-1 fw-bold" translate="no">čeština (CS)<span class="fw-normal"> (182.04 KB - PDF)</span></p><div class="dates-metadata d-grid d-lg-flex flex-lg-row gap-1 gap-lg-3 align-content-start"><small class="metadata-row first-published fw-normal text-muted" translate="no">
                            <strong class="label" translate="yes">First published: </strong>
                            <span class="value">16/03/2017</span>
                          </small><small class="metadata-row last-updated fw-normal text-muted" translate="no">
                            <strong class="label" translate="yes">Last updated: </strong>
                            <span class="value">28/05/2026</span>
                          </small></div>
                    </div>
                  </div><a target="_blank" class="d-block standalone mt-3-5 mt-md-0" href="/cs/documents/overview/olumiant-epar-medicine-overview_cs.pdf">View<svg
